<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/00867698247a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Federal Trade Commission has opened an expansive investigation into OpenAI, probing whether the maker of the popular ChatGPT bot has run afoul of consumer protection laws." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6263" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/173e5806513d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Canadian privacy regulators are launching a joint investigation into ChatGPT-parent OpenAI's data collection and usage, becoming the latest major government to take a closer look at the regulation of artificial intelligence (AI) tools." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6254" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/22c37ed10e77> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Canada to launch probe into OpenAI over privacy concerns" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6254" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/26cd5c6927fc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A statement on Thursday said provincial authorities in Alberta, British Columbia and Quebec have joined the investigation launched by the Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada in April because the issue affects people across the country." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6264" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/26e050221aae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "OpenAI has already built a filter to stop its older GPT-3 model from spitting out people's phone numbers, for example." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7901" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/294055376b19> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Federal and provincial privacy authorities in Canada are pursuing a joint investigation into OpenAI... Italy's data protection authority launched an investigation over suspected breach of privacy rules." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6264" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/312607e398ed> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Italy became the first country to temporarily ban the program by government order after its own data protection authority launched an investigation in April over the app's suspected breach of privacy rules." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6264" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/45de7bfba82d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "AI technology and its effects on privacy is a priority for my Office, the country's privacy commissioner Philippe Dufresne declared in a statement this week." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7901" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/50df86ad58ca> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Canadian privacy regulators are launching a joint investigation into ChatGPT-parent OpenAI's data collection and usage, becoming the latest major government to take a closer look at the regulation of artificial intelligence (AI) tools." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6254" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/741a32a0f11e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Powered by the GPT-3.5 large language model, ChatGPT was trained on huge swaths of text scraped from the internet." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7901" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9584abe5944b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Canadian privacy regulators are launching a joint investigation into ChatGPT-parent OpenAI... becoming the latest major government to take a closer look at the regulation of artificial intelligence (AI) tools." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6254" .

