    airo:evidenceText "The Federal Trade Commission has opened an expansive investigation into OpenAI, probing whether the maker of the popular ChatGPT bot has run afoul of consumer protection laws by putting personal reputations and data at risk." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6263" .

