    airo:evidenceText "The Federal Trade Commission has opened an expansive investigation into OpenAI, probing whether the maker of the popular ChatGPT bot has run afoul of consumer protection laws." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6263" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/977eae940a59> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The complaint that sparked the investigation claimed the company unlawfully collected, used and disclosed personal information without consent through ChatGPT, its artificial intelligence-powered chatbot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6264" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b8ae52f6309d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The complaint that sparked the investigation claimed the company unlawfully collected, used and disclosed personal information without consent through ChatGPT, its artificial intelligence-powered chatbot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6264" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/de6b63a83261> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada is investigating OpenAI's generative language app ChatGPT after the watchdog received a complaint claiming the software was collecting, using, and disclosing personal information without consent." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7901" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e7ef2800d707> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Federal Trade Commission has opened an expansive investigation into OpenAI... Italian authorities temporarily banned the program by government order after launching an investigation." ;
